# Kiro agent workspace — local authoring aid, never published.
# Mirrored intent of the publish repo's .gitignore so `git status` stays clean
# if this local copy is ever initialized as a git repo. The authoritative
# exclusion is in the publish repo's .gitignore, which sync-to-publish.ps1 honors.
.kiro/
